                                                "sense_id": "6f9d0064-32e2-3143-b346-4459bd6d1097",
                                                "text": "The guard lobbed a pass just over the defender."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b91d02da-199e-4c58-8f79-1a2662962787",
                                                "sense_id": "6f9d0064-32e2-3143-b346-4459bd6d1097",
                                                "text": "The tennis player lobbed the ball, which was a costly mistake."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79757c86-2adf-326b-9ec4-e73a8e3e2a28",
                                        "entry_id": "dbcf4c74-529f-32d5-8d8c-96c6fa01385f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To throw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f4fa706-eba7-453a-b6fa-f4589ee5fa7b",
                                                "sense_id": "79757c86-2adf-326b-9ec4-e73a8e3e2a28",
                                                "text": "In the months leading up to the election, government representatives took up a cybercrime case against Thanathorn for criticising the government on a Facebook Live video... They also lobbed more legal cases at his party for allegedly spreading false information."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4a869cb-2f06-4d64-979a-f27cb4099d4d",
                                                "sense_id": "79757c86-2adf-326b-9ec4-e73a8e3e2a28",
                                                "text": "I'm sure the Brunel-designed stone-built structure would have had a hatstand for his trademark stovepipe. I can picture him rocking up there of a morning and lobbing it nonchalantly onto the hatstand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e64b947d-75a6-3c62-8008-27693ef33bea",
                                        "entry_id": "dbcf4c74-529f-32d5-8d8c-96c6fa01385f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To put, place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdda0b2b-d9d1-450b-b196-fbaf4fa536d5",
                                                "sense_id": "e64b947d-75a6-3c62-8008-27693ef33bea",
                                                "text": "Lob the bacon in the pot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1831160f-ef4e-36d1-8454-aa2c6b016053",
                                        "entry_id": "dbcf4c74-529f-32d5-8d8c-96c6fa01385f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To hit, kick, or throw a ball over another player in a game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0726e7ba-f9f7-4c9a-96e2-9b3b7633eaab",
                                                "sense_id": "1831160f-ef4e-36d1-8454-aa2c6b016053",
                                                "text": "Wigan took the lead when Hugo Rodallega lobbed David Stockdale from close range having earlier headed against the post."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d89e0dd-c281-3fea-8655-50930e0b8b6f",
                                        "entry_id": "dbcf4c74-529f-32d5-8d8c-96c6fa01385f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To let fall heavily or lazily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da7d08c3-3cf0-46c2-95f5-fcab946ac32c",
                                                "sense_id": "9d89e0dd-c281-3fea-8655-50930e0b8b6f",
                                                "text": "And their poor jades / Lob down their heads."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d01fd8e8-81e7-3bb4-a2c4-c81f57dd058d",
                                        "entry_id": "dbcf4c74-529f-32d5-8d8c-96c6fa01385f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reach or arrive at (a place)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "informal",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90bf9faf-7cf6-42b9-86c3-81114b9191fe",
                                                "sense_id": "d01fd8e8-81e7-3bb4-a2c4-c81f57dd058d",
                                                "text": "So with great trepidation we lobbed at the theatre and were escorted to our seats[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
