                                                "example_id": "9cf13990-91ca-4b47-b0c7-2465e33afe20",
                                                "sense_id": "af33bb1d-e1e3-3269-b44c-362fc2f2e15c",
                                                "text": "Peter Lovenkrands went close for the Magpies, hitting the bar with a fine lob after he had been played in by the excellent Jose Enrique on the left."
