                                                "sense_id": "5573454d-2416-3a96-a643-5ebbce00e5a2",
                                                "text": "THE country lob trudged home very much concerned and thoughtful, you may swear; insomuch that his good woman, seeing him thus look moping, weened that something had been stolen from him at market […]"
